# CloakerX SaaS rules

- Billing is **Stripe USD only** (Spec 2). **Never** revive Cakto checkout/webhook/offers/fatia 3b.
- Cakto artifacts: `_archive/cakto/` only. Orphan `cakto_*` DB objects — leave unless user asks for a drop migration.
- No metered overage. Extra capacity = licensed packs on a **separate** Stripe sub (`kind=packs`).
- Catalogs: `stripe-catalog.test.json` (default UI) and `stripe-catalog.live.json`. Keep UI on test IDs until explicit go-live.
- Do not edit motor/VPS (`Documents/CloakerX/motor`) unless the user explicitly switches to the motor track.
- Prefer fail-closed RLS/`activation_status` over UI-only locks.
- Full context: root `CLAUDE.md`.
